-//! | add / mul / fma | AVX2 (`vaddpd` / `vmulpd` / `vfmadd231pd`) | NEON (`fadd` / `fmul` / `fmla`) | RVV 1.0 (`vfadd.vv` / `vfmul.vv` / `vfmacc.vv`) |
